  "title": "Grilled Butternut Squash with Maple-Brown Sugar Glaze",
  "description": "Butternut squash is brushed with a sweet maple and brown sugar glaze before it's wrapped in foil and grilled tender in this quick and easy side dish recipe.",
  "authors": [
